{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18304180","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18304180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1830418001:1":{"text":"约克冬·布莱克到此一游，带着全家骨灰来的。风景不错，就是风大，把我耳朵吹掉一个。","source_cn":"约克冬·布莱克到此一游，带着全家骨灰来的。风景不错，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFE2B3926B34A22C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1830418002:1":{"text":"伊迪丝·韦斯特，到此一游。帮丈夫刻的，他散架了，来不了。","source_cn":"伊迪丝·韦斯特，到此一游。帮丈夫刻的，他散架了，来不了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C6569A4738A98FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1830418003:1":{"text":"艾琳到此一游，和我最爱的人。","source_cn":"艾琳到此一游，和我最爱的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D64B53FE4D650D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830418004:1":{"text":"西尔维亚到此一游。西尔维亚和艾琳永远死在一起。","source_cn":"西尔维亚到此一游。西尔维亚和艾琳永远死在一起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD548ED0DB0D8BCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830418005:1":{"text":"汉弗莱·克罗斯，打卡。活着欠债，死了还愿。两清。","source_cn":"汉弗莱·克罗斯，打卡。活着欠债，死了还愿。两清。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6CADA1C1ED145B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn"